<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>3</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Financial Code related documents are separated into two sections: Financial Coding 1 &amp; 2.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Financial Coding 1</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>This section contains all of the GL Accounts, Program Activities, and IO/Project #.  Each document consists of the coding type (GL, PA, or IO), the English Name, French Name, and Code.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>These Financial Coding 1 documents are used to build the Financial Coding 2 documents, as well as to offer French names to those using the French interface to place orders.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>To create a new Financial Code:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.	From the Admin section of the database, click on "Financial Coding 1", then click on </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>"New Type"</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> on the Action Bar.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='73%'/>
