<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Select a type, then fill in the English Name, French Name and Code fields.  All fields MUST be filled in order to ensure the application functions properly.  </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Do not use commas in any of the descriptions.</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  If the Type selected is</run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> Intern</run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>al Order/Project#</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>, then the English Name entered will be used for the Project Name in the </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Projects</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> section of the database (see </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Creating and Maintaining Project Documents</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>).</run></par>
